@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://conference#Conference> owl:equivalentClass <http://ekaw#Conference> .

<http://conference#Contribution> owl:equivalentClass <http://ekaw#Article> .

<http://conference#Person> rdfs:subClassOf <http://ekaw#Researcher> .

<http://conference#Reviewer> owl:equivalentClass <http://ekaw#Reviewer> .

<http://conference#writtenBy> owl:equivalentProperty <http://ekaw#authoredBy> .

